{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3898f7545273563d","name":"K'kayeh Dreambeast","source":{"id":"source:reference-3898f7545273563d","title":"K'kayeh Dreambeast","revision":21645,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:12:27Z","sha256":"12572ba633c0971a6ca29998fe29ff56da8518afc0dc2539515337aba8668c18","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21645","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=K%27kayeh%20Dreambeast&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3898f7545273563d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Echoes of the Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Echoes_of_the_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:e6a2e80208e1e351"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The most disturbing thing about the beast is its snout. Sure, you've read the fairy tales about fire-breathing monsters. You may even have fought a dragon-slug on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corulag"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corulag","referenceId":"reference:dd86bfdc9751f625"},". But as you watch dark side lightning dance wickedly from one of the creature's mammoth nostrils to the other, you know only one thing for certain... you're in trouble."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["K'kayeh Dragon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/K%27kayeh_Dragon?action=edit&redlink=1"}," is the greatest product of Darth Rivan's dark arts. A Force-sensitive abomination, this Sithspawn's sandy scales match the color of Almas' desert wasteland and are as tough as armor plating. The serpentine creature is also amphibious, as comfortable in open air as swimming in the planet's hidden underground lakes. The K'kayeh's maw is a steely-toothed deathtrap, and its claws are eviscerating razors. As if that weren't enough, instead of breathing fire, this Dark Side abomination can shoot ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Lightning"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Lightning","referenceId":"reference:a654f003ddc04a24"}]}," from each nostril of its monstrous snout.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This \"Dreambeast\" is only a tenth the size of the truly gigantic ",{"tag":"a","children":["K'kayeh Dragon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/K%27kayeh_Dragon?action=edit&redlink=1"}," that lurks in the depths of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Almas Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Almas_Academy"},", but it is still enormous. Similar to Sith dopplegangers, this K'kayeh Dreambeast is an illusory clone of the actual living entity, spawned by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Inquisitor Valin Draco"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inquisitor_Valin_Draco"}," under the guidance of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Rivan's Holocron Gatekeeper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Rivan%27s_Holocron_Gatekeeper","referenceId":"reference:324f60578f6c6ead"},". Despite its partially insubstantial state, the Dreambeast can still hurt its targets.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["K'kayeh Dreambeast Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +7; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.mi